{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00066",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 4.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.63,
      "end_seconds": 8.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.48,
      "end_seconds": 18.69,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a little chest discomfort. I don't know what's causing it. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.47,
      "end_seconds": 22.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.42,
      "end_seconds": 30.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "I mean, I've had it for two years. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.14,
      "end_seconds": 43.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "Right. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.63,
      "end_seconds": 60.24,
      "duration_seconds": 15.61,
      "text": "Only resting, and it's not much. It's worse with walking uphill. I've never really been one for hospitals. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I've also had breathlessness on slopes, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.51,
      "end_seconds": 64.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "So, on a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.01,
      "end_seconds": 70.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Maybe a four out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.15,
      "end_seconds": 73.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Have you had any fainting or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.05,
      "end_seconds": 79.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.92,
      "end_seconds": 87.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.67,
      "end_seconds": 91.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Uh, no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.55,
      "end_seconds": 94.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.15,
      "end_seconds": 97.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.05,
      "end_seconds": 105.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.12,
      "end_seconds": 110.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Hmm, no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.1,
      "end_seconds": 115.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.31,
      "end_seconds": 118.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "My father had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.93,
      "end_seconds": 121.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.6,
      "end_seconds": 135.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.52,
      "end_seconds": 161.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 76, pressure 127 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.94,
      "end_seconds": 164.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Okay, so is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.56,
      "end_seconds": 168.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.31,
      "end_seconds": 173.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.2,
      "end_seconds": 177.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.2,
      "end_seconds": 195.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Chest is clear and heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.43,
      "end_seconds": 198.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.91,
      "end_seconds": 201.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.32,
      "end_seconds": 216.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "The scar on your chest has healed well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.32,
      "end_seconds": 219.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.67,
      "end_seconds": 247.2,
      "duration_seconds": 25.53,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Putting it all together, this looks most like stable recovery after the heart event. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let's get an echocardiogram, for follow-up. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.12,
      "end_seconds": 253.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.7,
      "end_seconds": 276.55,
      "duration_seconds": 19.85,
      "text": "I'll start you on atorvastatin, 40 milligrams, at night, long term. You take it by mouth. That should help with cardiovascular risk. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Please don't stop the blood thinner on your own, even if you feel fine. Cardiac rehab is worth doing, it really helps your confidence."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.43,
      "end_seconds": 292.95,
      "duration_seconds": 15.52,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'll also refer you to cardiac rehabilitation. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.08,
      "end_seconds": 295.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.7,
      "end_seconds": 298.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Let's review you in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.99,
      "end_seconds": 302.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Right, okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.57,
      "end_seconds": 305.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Okay, good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.11,
      "end_seconds": 308.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}